6502DOS V0.1.0
For the Commander X16
>>RUN CMDSHELL.COM
C>LIST HEL        LIST HELLO.BAS
10 PRINT "HELLO FROM A FILE"
20 FOR I=1 TO 3:PRINT I;:NEXT
30 PRINT
C>list docs\re            list docs\README.TXT
DOCS holds LONG.TXT, 50 lines of 64 bytes.
C>VER   VER   VERSION
6502DOS V0.1.0
C>VER   VER   VERSION       VER
6502DOS V0.1.0
C>PRI   PRINT "TAB"
TAB
C>CD DO     CD DOCS\
C>PRINT CURDIR$
C:\DOCS
C>CD \
C>CD DO     CD DOCS\        CD DOS\
C>PRINT CURDIR$
C:\DOS
C>CD \
C>XYZ   XYZ
Bad command or file name
C>PATH$ = "C:\DOS"
C>TRE   TREE -?
Invalid switch
C>WHE   WHERE HEAD
C:\DOS\HEAD.COM
C>COPY HELLO.TXT "Q R.TXT"
     1 File(s) copied
C>TYPE Q      TYPE "Q R.TXT"
Hello from the SD card.
C>TYPE "Q         TYPE "Q R.TXT"
Hello from the SD card.
C>DEL "Q R.TXT"
C>MD "Z DIR"
C>CD Z    CD "Z DIR\
C>PRINT CURDIR$
C:\Z DIR
C>CD \
C>RD "Z DIR"
C>END

>>